  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nRight now, any 'grouping' of icons is to be done either via Categories, which span over the entire screen horizontally, or dynamic sections - which can be adjusted in horizontal size. \r\nTo me personally, dynamic sections make much more sense visually than categories, and it would be great for them to be a bit editable - mainly, to have editable title and fold button (maybe something that can be enabled/disabled in settings?).\r\n\r\nThis will enable users to have groups of apps/integrations neatly organized, named, and possibly - folded when not needed. Also enables groups of links/apps/integrations to be grouped side-by-side (super-useful for large displays) rather than stacked below each other.\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
